<title>GERMANY: Mannesmann Demag sells unit to Siebe.</title>
<headline>Mannesmann Demag sells unit to Siebe.</headline>
<dateline>DUISBURG, Germany 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mannesmann Demag AG said on Tuesday it had sold its compressor division to the British firm Siebe Plc for 20.3 million sterling.</p>
<p>The deal must still be approved by cartel authorities and the supervisory board, Mannesmann said.</p>
<p>The compressor division had 160 million marks in sales and 554 employees in 1995.</p>
<p>Siebe's 1995 sales were 2.5 billion pounds. It employs 42,000.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
